# @name resetLogin
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "identifier": "{{created.response.body.$.employeeCode}}", "password": "{{reset.response.body.$.temporaryPassword}}" }

### A second reset signs out the session above: refresh with the cookie of "resetLogin" → 401
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/users/{{created.response.body.$.id}}/reset-password
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

