### ---------- Last active admin ----------
### Reachable only with a stale token: 1) Yael makes Adi an admin, 2) Adi signs in, 3) Yael removes Admin from Adi
### (the access token of Adi still says Admin for up to 15 minutes), 4) Adi removes Admin from Yael → 422 "last-admin".

### 1. Adi becomes Admin
PUT {{API_HostAddress}}/api/users/25
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "עדי", "lastName": "שמעוני", "email": "adi.shimoni@example.com", "departmentId": 6, "jobTitle": "רכזת משאבי אנוש", "roles": ["Handler", "Admin"] }

