Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "חניה ותחבורה", "description": "חניה, תווי חניה והסעות", "routingType": "RequesterDepartmentHr", "isActive": false }

### Deactivate GENERAL (fallback) → 422 "fallback-category-deactivation"
PUT {{API_HostAddress}}/api/categories/8
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "כללי", "description": "תור גיבוי – כל מה שלא סווג", "routingType": "FixedDepartment", "handlingDepartmentId": 6, "isActive": false }

### Admin, including inactive → PARKING listed with isActive false
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/categories?includeInactive=true
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Unknown category → 404
PUT {{API_HostAddress}}/api/categories/99999
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "x", "description": "y", "routingType": "RequesterDepartmentHr", "isActive": true }

### ---------- SLA policies (spec 3.4) ----------

### Any signed-in user → 200 { critical: 4, high: 24, medium: 72, low: 120 }
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/sla-policies
Authorization: Bearer {{employee.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Employee cannot change → 403
PUT {{API_HostAddress}}/api/sla-policies
Authorization: Bearer {{employee.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "critical": 2, "high": 8, "medium": 48, "low": 96 }

### Valid change → 200 (new tickets only; existing DueAt values are kept). AuditLog "SlaPolicies.Updated".
PUT {{API_HostAddress}}/api/sla-policies
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "critical": 2, "high": 8, "medium": 48, "low": 96 }

### Out of order (high < critical) → 400, errors.high
PUT {{API_HostAddress}}/api/sla-policies
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "critical": 24, "high": 8, "medium": 48, "low": 96 }

### Zero, a fraction and a missing level → 400, errors.critical / high / low
PUT {{API_HostAddress}}/api/sla-policies
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "critical": 0, "high": 1.5, "medium": 48 }

### Reset all of the above: dotnet run --project API -- --seed

### ======================================================================================
### ============ Invitation e-mail (addition, not in the spec) – run in order after --seed ============
### ======================================================================================
### Mail delivery (appsettings.Development.json, "Email"):
###   Provider "File" (default): every e-mail is written to Backend/API/App_Data/emails/*.eml (git-ignored).
###     Open it in any mail client / text editor and copy the token after "#token=" in the link.
###   Provider "Smtp" with smtp4dev: run smtp4dev (web UI http://localhost:5000, SMTP port 25), set
###     "Provider": "Smtp" (Host localhost, Port 25, Security None are already set), restart the API.
### The seed has one invited employee: נגה ברק, id 26, EMP-00026 – no password, invitation sent on the first run.
### Set the token you copied here:
@inviteToken = paste-the-token-from-the-eml-file

### Run "Admin login – Yael Harpaz" at the top of "User administration" first.

### Status in the user DTO → "invitation": { "status": "Sent", "at": ... } (Pending until the worker ran, ~10 s)
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/users/26
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### The list carries the status too
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/users?search=EMP-00026
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Filter by invitation status (Pending | Sent | Used | Expired | Failed | Revoked) → only users whose latest
### invitation is in that state; never-invited users never match
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/users?invitationStatus=Sent
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Unknown invitation status → 400, errors.invitationStatus
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/users?invitationStatus=Lost
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Before setting a password: no password signs in → 401 uniform
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "identifier": "EMP-00026", "password": "Demo1234" }

### Weak password → 400, errors.newPassword (the link stays valid)
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/set-password
Content-Type: application/json

{ "token": "{{inviteToken}}", "newPassword": "abc" }

### Set the password (anonymous) → 204. The link is now used; other links revoked; AuditLog "Invitation.PasswordSet"
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/set-password
Content-Type: application/json

{ "token": "{{inviteToken}}", "newPassword": "Noga2026x" }

### The same link again → 400 "הקישור אינו בתוקף. יש לפנות למנהל המערכת." (type invalid-invitation)
### Same answer for an unknown, expired (72 hours) or revoked link, or an inactive employee
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/set-password
Content-Type: application/json

{ "token": "{{inviteToken}}", "newPassword": "Noga2026y" }

### Unknown token → the same 400
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/set-password
Content-Type: application/json

{ "token": "no-such-token", "newPassword": "Noga2026y" }

### Sign in with the new password → 200, mustChangePassword: false
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "identifier": "EMP-00026", "password": "Noga2026x" }

### Status → "Used"
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/users/26
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### ---------- Resend: POST /api/users/{id}/invitation (Admin) ----------

### To an employee who already chose a password (Noga now, or Noa) → 422 "password-already-set"
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/users/4/invitation
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### New employee → 201, invitation Pending
# @name invited
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "טל", "lastName": "בדיקה", "email": "tal.test@example.com", "departmentId": 2, "jobTitle": "מפתח" }

### Resend → 200, Pending again. The earlier link (if already sent) is revoked; a queued e-mail is cancelled,
### so the worker sends one e-mail with a new link. AuditLog "Invitation.Resent"
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/users/{{invited.response.body.$.id}}/invitation
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### After ~10 s → "Sent"
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/users/{{invited.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Reset password instead → 200 { temporaryPassword }; the open link is revoked → status "Revoked"
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/users/{{invited.response.body.$.id}}/reset-password
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

###
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/users/{{invited.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Unknown user → 404
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/users/99999/invitation
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Failure: with Provider "Smtp" and no SMTP server listening, the worker retries after 1, 5 and 30 minutes
### (job Pending, LastErrorCode "SmtpConnectionFailed"), then marks it Failed → status "Failed",
### AuditLog "Invitation.SendFailed". The admin then resends. Neither the token nor the address is ever logged.
### Rate limit: more than 10 set-password requests from one IP within 15 minutes → 429.

### ============ Tickets – task 3.1 (the requester's view) ============
### Noa opens and views her own tickets; Ido is "another employee".

# @name noa
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "identifier": "noa.berkovich@example.com", "password": "{{password}}" }

###
# @name ido
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "identifier": "ido.sagi@example.com", "password": "{{password}}" }

### Create → 201 + Location /api/tickets/{id} + { "id": ... }. "requesterId" in the body is ignored:
### the requester is Noa (from the token), the department is her current one (from the database).
# @name newTicket
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{noa.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "requesterId": 2, "subject": "שעות נוספות שלא שולמו", "description": "בתלוש של אוקטובר חסרות 6 שעות נוספות מה-14 בחודש." }

### Create without a subject → 201; the list shows the start of the description ("isSubjectExcerpt": true)
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{noa.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "description": "המחשב נתקע כל בוקר בזמן ההפעלה ולוקח לו כרבע שעה לעלות." }

### Description too short / whitespace only, subject over 150 → 400 with errors by field
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{noa.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "subject": "אאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאאא", "description": "    " }

### My tickets – newest first (default), page 1 of 25
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/my
Authorization: Bearer {{noa.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Filter by several statuses + search in the subject + sort by last update
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/my?status=New&status=Assigned&status=InProgress&search=תלוש&sortBy=updatedAt&sortDir=desc&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{noa.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Sort field outside the closed list / pageSize over 100 → 400
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/my?sortBy=dueAt&pageSize=500
Authorization: Bearer {{noa.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Unknown status → 400 (binding)
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/my?status=Archived
Authorization: Bearer {{noa.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Summary cards → { open, waitingForMe, closedThisMonth }
### open = New/Assigned/InProgress/Resolved; closedThisMonth = Closed since the 1st of the month, Israel time
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/my/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{noa.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### View the new ticket → 200, details + timeline (opening entry). No urgency, dueAt, AI or internal data.
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/{{newTicket.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{noa.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Another employee views Noa's ticket → 404 (not 403)
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/{{newTicket.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ido.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Unknown ticket → 404
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{noa.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Rate limit: more than 20 new tickets per hour per user → 429 with
### detail "ניתן לפתוח עד 20 פניות בשעה. יש לנסות שוב מאוחר יותר." (requests rejected with 400 also count).
